  "description": "Timothy's Positions Update",
  "body_html": "<p>Price action…price action…price action. </p><p>I say it nearly every day, and will continue to say it. We always respect price action, protect profits and protect initial capital. We can always get back in later…but there is NO reason to let 20%, 30% and 40% profits get away from us…hoping…that it reverses. Maybe they will. But <strong>hope is not a strategy.</strong> It is a banned word in my chat and will cause many portfolio’s demise one day. </p><p>The market is having a bloody Friday morning open. Does that mean everything is done for? <strong>NO</strong></p><p>This post is for subscribers to give you an update on where I stand with our current positions. I have locked down some profits this morning and a few others I am monitoring closely. Also, a quick update on our long term “Lazy” 2026 ETF positions we built…which I am not concerned about at all. In fact, many of them are green today! 🥳 </p><p>I have actually wanted to ditch some of these positions, to continue building the Lazy portfolio. (Don’t worry short term traders I will still occasionally pick up trades when they present themselves!). I have 2 stocks on my radar to potentially pick up this afternoon. I will provide a update later today, and if I pick up those positions it will be updated in <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">Quick Notes</a> and the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a>.</p><h4>The portfolio changes include:</h4>",
